WEBVTT

00:08:31.114 --> 00:08:35.038
This is an amphibious design.

00:08:35.466 --> 00:08:38.336
This park is not
about getting rid of flood.

00:08:38.753 --> 00:08:41.963
It's about creating a way to live with it.

00:08:42.741 --> 00:08:47.194
And not a single drop of rain
is wasted in this park.

00:08:48.133 --> 00:08:54.135
This park can hold and collect
a million gallons of water.

00:08:56.873 --> 00:08:58.023
(Applause)

00:08:58.047 --> 00:08:59.237
Thank you.

00:08:59.261 --> 00:09:03.319
(Applause)